exact Revit version work with any Revit version installed on the computer.\r\n- Revit 2014–2020 and 2027 support has been checked against each version's API but not yet on a computer with those versions installed.\r\n- Revit 2028 is not released yet. It will be added in a later version.\r\n- The add-in is unsigned. When Revit shows the security prompt, choose `Always Load`; `Load Once` asks again on every start.\r\n\r\n### Installation\r\n\r\n1. Download `PaperEngineerShell_1.3.0.msi`.\r\n2. Close all Windows Explorer windows and Revit.\r\n3. Run the installer as administrator. It replaces any earlier Revit Shell or PaperEngineer Shell version.\r\n4. Right-click a supported Revit file to access the PaperEngineer Shell commands.\r\n\r\n### Requirements\r\n\r\n- Windows 10 or Windows 11\r\n- .NET Framework 4.8\r\n- Autodesk Revit installed for the versions you want to open (Detach and Create new local: Revit 2014–2027)\r\n\r\n### License\r\n\r\nUse, modification, and redistribution are permitted with attribution to **PaperEngineer**.\r\n"}